### Finding 1 — Tenant camelCase in handler error messages
**Status**: ✅ **CONFIRMED**

Error messages in multiple handlers still say `"Missing tenantId"` (camelCase) instead of `"Missing tenant_id"` (snake_case). Observed in:

- [wholesale_extended_handler.go:44](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#L44), [L87](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#L87), [L147](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#L147), [L190](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#L190), [L226](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#L226)
- [lazada/product_extended_handler.go:28](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/lazada/product_extended_handler.go#L28), all 4 handler methods
- [platform_auth_handler.go:109](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/platform_auth_handler.go#L109), [L48](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/platform_auth_handler.go#L48), [L154](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/platform_auth_handler.go#L154)
- [analytics/unified_handler.go:43](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/analytics/unified_handler.go#L43) and all handler methods

**Also found**: `ads_handler.go:50` uses `"Missing tenantId"` AND misses the `success: false` envelope (raw `{"error": ...}`).

**Severity**: Low — cosmetic, but violates canonical snake_case naming.

