### Finding 5 — WholesaleExtendedHandler opens tenant DB in handler
**Status**: ✅ **CONFIRMED**

[wholesale_extended_handler.go:200](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#L200):
```go
db, err := config.GetTenantDB(tenantID, h.basePath)
```
The [LookupItemId](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/wholesale_extended_handler.go#185-220) handler at L200 calls `config.GetTenantDB()` directly (bypassing the [getDB()](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/ads_handler.go#22-26) helper on line 33) and then instantiates `repositories.NewShopeeProductRepository(db)` directly. This violates the "handler shouldn't open DB" principle.

**Severity**: Medium — SRP violation. Should use the existing [getDB()](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/ads_handler.go#22-26) helper and push to service layer.

