### Finding 15 — Batch price update always HTTP 200
**Status**: ✅ **CONFIRMED**

[inventory/price_handler.go:157-167](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/inventory/price_handler.go#L157-L167):
```go
response := gin.H{
    "success": totalFailed == 0,
    ...
}
c.JSON(http.StatusOK, response)
```
Even when `totalFailed > 0` and `"success": false`, the HTTP status is always 200. A monitoring system relying on HTTP status codes would see this as success.

**Severity**: Medium — misleading for monitoring/alerting.

