### Finding 38 — LoginPage hardcoded dev tenants
**Status**: ✅ **CONFIRMED**

[LoginPage.tsx:44-45](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/src/pages/auth/LoginPage.tsx#L44-L45):
```typescript
const [selectedDevTenant, setSelectedDevTenant] = useState("yumna_bertigamart");
```

[L113-121](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/src/pages/auth/LoginPage.tsx#L113-L121): Auto-login on localhost:
```typescript
if (isLocalhost && !isAuthenticated && !sessionStorage.getItem("autoLoginFailed")) {
  handleDevLogin(true);
}
```

[L201-202](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/src/pages/auth/LoginPage.tsx#L201-L202): Hardcoded tenant options:
```tsx
<Option value="yumna_bertigamart">Yumna - Bertigamart</Option>
<Option value="tika_nusseyba">Tika - Nusseyba</Option>
```

**Severity**: Low — dev-only feature, properly gated by `isLocalhost`. Hardcoded tenants should be in config.

