### Finding 39 — Vite config drift/orphan
**Status**: ✅ **CONFIRMED**

Found 3 Vite config files in `frontend/`:
- [vite.config.ts](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/vite.config.ts) — source TypeScript config
- [vite.config.js](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/vite.config.js) — compiled JavaScript (likely generated artifact)
- [vite.config.d.ts](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/vite.config.d.ts) — TypeScript declaration (likely generated)

The [.js](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/vite.config.js) and [.d.ts](file:///d:/Project/omni/frontend/vite.config.d.ts) files are likely build artifacts that shouldn't be tracked in source control.

**Severity**: Low — workspace hygiene. Check .gitignore.

---

### Finding 40 — Root npm test is false positive shim
**Status**: ✅ **CONFIRMED**

[package.json:7](file:///d:/Project/omni/package.json#L7):
```json
"test": "echo \"Run tests from frontend/ (npm test) or backend/ (go test ./...)\" && exit 0"
```
Always exits 0. This will pass in any CI that runs `npm test` at root level.

**Severity**: Medium — CI false positive risk. Should exit 1 or delegate properly.

