## Part 4: Comprehensive Remediation Plan

### Phase 1: Critical Security & Data Integrity (Priority: HIGH)

| # | Finding(s) | Action | Risk | Effort |
|---|-----------|--------|------|--------|
| 1 | F19 | **Decrypt: fail-hard when ENCRYPTION_KEY missing**: Remove base64 fallback in `global_config.go:286-292`. Add startup check that ENCRYPTION_KEY is set in production. Keep fallback only behind `LEGACY_CRYPTO_FALLBACK=true` env var. | Data leak | M |
| 2 | F16, F17, Bug E | **Settings service: propagate errors**: Change [GetDetailedSettings()](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/services/google/settings_service.go#101-154) and [GetSpreadsheetLinks()](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/services/google/settings_service.go#396-416) to return errors. Fix `json.Unmarshal` error at L111. | Silent data loss | S |
| 3 | F25-27 | **Clone services: check read errors**: In all three `fetchXxxProductFromDB()`, check `First()` and `Find()` errors and return error if product/SKUs can't be read. | Incomplete clones | S |
| 4 | F20 | **Analytics: check MV query errors**: In [unified_handler.go](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/analytics/unified_handler.go), capture `.First()` errors on L94/L106/L192 and return 500 with error message. Log MV refresh failures. | Phantom metrics | S |
| 5 | F4 | **Deprecate body refresh token**: Add `Deprecation: true` header when body fallback is used. Log a security warning. Plan removal after frontend migration. | Token exposure | S |

### Phase 2: API Contract Standardization (Priority: MEDIUM-HIGH)

| # | Finding(s) | Action | Risk | Effort |
|---|-----------|--------|------|--------|
| 6 | F12-14 | **Wrap error responses**: Add `"success": false` to all error responses in [ads_handler.go](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/ads_handler.go), [price_handler.go](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/price_handler.go), [stock_handler.go](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/stock_handler.go). Use `response.Error()`. | Client parsing failure | M |
| 7 | F1, Bug A | **Standardize error messages**: Replace all `"Missing tenantId"` with `"Missing tenant_id"`. Fix `"checkedAt"` → `"checked_at"`. | API inconsistency | S |
| 8 | F15, Bug D | **Batch responses**: Use HTTP 207 Multi-Status or 200 with `success: false` + appropriate status. Fix hardcoded `"success"` in batch sync history. | Monitoring blind spot | S |
| 9 | F30 | **Inventory sync response**: Wrap with canonical `{success, data}` envelope. Deprecate `status/message` shape. | Contract drift | S |
| 10 | F31-33 | **Backend ads/columns endpoint stabilization**: Pick one response shape (`{items, pagination}`), remove array variant. Frontend can then drop dual-shape handling. | Frontend complexity | M |

### Phase 3: Architecture Cleanup (Priority: MEDIUM)

| # | Finding(s) | Action | Risk | Effort |
|---|-----------|--------|------|--------|
| 11 | F2, Bug B | **Tenant middleware consolidation**: Remove `"tenantId"` and `"tenantID"` aliases from middleware. Migration: grep all `c.GetString("tenantID")` and `c.GetString("tenantId")` → use `middleware.GetTenantID(c)`. | Handler breakage | L |
| 12 | F5-7, F9 | **Push DB/repo work to service layer**: Handlers should only call service methods, not instantiate repos. Create services where missing. | Coupling | L |
| 13 | F8 | **Split UnifiedHandler concerns**: Extract `UnifiedAnalyticsService` with methods for summary/KPI computation. Handler only does input validation + response. | Testability | M |
| 14 | F10 | **Extract ImageService**: Move query building, CRUD, file ops from handler to service. | SRP violation | M |
| 15 | F11 | **Move sync history to orchestrator**: [recordPriceSyncHistory()](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/inventory/price_handler.go#170-210) and [recordPriceBatchSyncHistory()](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/handlers/inventory/price_handler.go#211-248) should be called within the orchestrator, not from handler. | Layer violation | S |

### Phase 4: Logging & Observability (Priority: MEDIUM)

| # | Finding(s) | Action | Risk | Effort |
|---|-----------|--------|------|--------|
| 16 | F29, Bug F | **Migrate all log.Printf to zerolog**: 50+ locations across 15+ files. Use structured fields. | Log aggregation broken | L |
| 17 | F21 | **Queue history: check DB errors**: Add error checks on `.Find()` calls at L89 and L105 in [queue_manager_extended.go](file:///d:/Project/omni/backend/internal/services/jobs/queue_manager_extended.go). | Silent failures | S |
| 18 | F23-24, Bug C | **DB product handlers: check Find errors**: Add error checks on all `.Find()` calls in TikTok and Shopee db_products handlers. | Silent failures | S |
| 19 | F18 | **Check json.Marshal errors**: In `settings_service.go:190`, check and return error. | Data corruption | S |

